  "_comment": "WTF-520: repeating groups in a repeating group's cell, rendered per outer cell (two levels). Customers, their orders (an inner list fed by a search keyed on the outer cell) and each order's item count; a customer's own list of orders (an inner list fed by the outer cell's list field); a reusable card per order whose click picks its order. All data invented; test/support/target/phoenix/nested_lists_behavior.exs counts the queries.",
